e | Category | Problem Count | Key Concepts & Patterns |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 1 | **Arrays** | Data Structures | **165** | In-place mutations, two-pointer scans, prefix sums, partition |\n| 2 | **Strings** | Data Structures | **59** | Sliding windows, palindromes, anagram hashing, string encoding |\n| 3 | **Hashing and Hash Maps** | Data Structures | **162** | $O(1)$ lookups, complement searches, frequency counts, seen sets |\n| 4 | **Two Pointers** | Techniques & Patterns | **20** | Converging left/right pointers, fast/slow cycle detection, parallel scanning |\n| 5 | **Sliding Window** | Techniques & Patterns | **18** | Contiguous window expansions and dynamic shrinkage |\n| 6 | **Prefix Sum** | Techniques & Patterns | **7** | Cumulative running totals, subarray sum equals $K$, difference arrays |\n| 7 | **Binary Search** | Algorithms | **20** | Logarithmic search on sorted arrays, rotated arrays, and value spaces |\n| 8 | **Sorting** | Algorithms | **68** | Quicksort partitions, mergesort, custom key sorts, bucket sort |\n| 9 | **Linked Lists** | Data Structures | **22** | Node pointer redirections, reversals, dummy nodes, list merging |\n| 10 | **Stacks** | Data Structures | **21** | LIFO order, bracket validation, nested expression evaluation |\n| 11 | **Queues and Deques** | Data Structures | **17** | FIFO queues, double-ended queues, BFS queue management |\n| 12 | **Recursion** | Techniques & Patterns | **221** | Base cases, recursive call stacks, divide-and-conquer decomposition |\n| 13 | **Backtracking** | Techniques & Patterns | **18** | State-space decision tree traversal, branch pruning, permutations |\n| 14 | **Trees and Binary Trees** | Data Structures | **52** | DFS traversals (pre/in/postorder), BFS level-order, max depth, LCA |\n| 15 | **Binary Search Trees** | Data Structures | **19** | Sorted BST properties, in-order $O(h)$ search, BST insertion/deletion |\n| 16 | **Heaps and Priority Queues** | Data Structures | **16** | Min/max heaps, top-$K$ frequent elements, Dijkstra scheduling |\n| 17 | **Graphs** | Data Structures | **38** | Adjacency lists, connectivity, cycle detection, bipartite testing |\n| 18 | **Breadth-First Search (BFS)** | Algorithms | **16** | Layer-by-layer queue traversal, shortest path in unweighted graphs |\n| 19 | **Depth-First Search (DFS)** | Algorithms | **86** | Deep branch exploration, component flood-fill, topological sorting |\n| 20 | **Greedy Algorithms** | Algorithms | **10** | Locally optimal choice at each step, jump games, gas stations |\n| 21 | **Dynamic Programming** | Techniques & Patterns | **42** | Overlapping subproblems, state memoization, bottom-up DP tables |\n| 22 | **Bit Manipulation** | Techniques & Patterns | **6** | Bitwise AND, OR, XOR, shifts, two's complement, single number trick |\n| 23 | **Tries** | Data Structures | **8** | Prefix trees, dictionary word search, wildcard prefix matching |\n| 24 | **Union-Find** | Data Structures | **13** | Disjoint-set forest, path compression, union by rank, cycle detection |\n| 25 | **Topological Sorting** | Algorithms | **4** | Kahn's in-degree algorithm, DAG dependency resolution, Course Schedule |\n| 26 | **Intervals** | Techniques & Patterns | **4** | Start/end time sorting, interval merging, overlap detection |\n| 27 | **Monotonic Stack and Queue** | Data Structures | **10** | Next greater/smaller element in $O(n)$, sliding window extrema |\n| 28 | **Math and Number Theory** | Algorithms | **51** | Modulo arithmetic, Euclidean GCD, prime sieves, digit extraction |\n| 29 | **Matrix Problems** | Data Structures | **24** | 2D grid traversals, in-place rotations, spiral orders, flood-fills |\n| 30 | **Advanced Data Structures** | Data Structures | **10** | LRU/LFU cache, Segment Trees, Fenwick trees, Dual-Heap Median Finder |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Dedicated Topic Pages\n\nUsers can click on any of the 30 topic cards to open a **Dedicated Topic Page**:\n1. **Header & Concept Overview:**\n   * Large topic ico